  "question": {
    "text": "Let $A$ be a $2 \\times 2$ matrix with $\\operatorname{det}(A)=-1$ and $\\operatorname{det}((A+I)(\\operatorname{Adj}(A)+I))=4$. Then the sum of the diagonal elements of $A$ can be:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>, so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Now given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mo>adj</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
